 x="517" y="288" text-anchor="middle">reads leaf rows [40, 50) and pays</text></g></g><g><text class="num" x="14" y="340" text-anchor="middle">5</text><g class="tg tg-changed"><rect x="26" y="327" width="58" height="18" rx="9"/><text x="55" y="340" text-anchor="middle">changed</text></g><g class="self k-money"><rect x="216.8" y="323" width="260.4" height="26" rx="13"/><text x="347" y="340" text-anchor="middle">holder half goes to Paul’s leaf band</text></g></g><text class="bal" x="844" y="340" text-anchor="middle">20</text><text class="bal" x="952" y="340" text-anchor="middle">0</text><text class="bal chg" x="1060" y="340" text-anchor="middle">½ fee</text></svg></div><p class="cap"><b>Option b: all 20 paid leaf blocks have an owner.</b> The read pays Paul.</p></div></section>"`;

